@startuml
title EVisaProcessingAndFollowUpSystem State Machine
[*] --> UserAccountCreated

state UserAccountCreated
state LoggedIn
state VisaApplicationPending
state VisaApproved
state VisaRejected
state StatusViewed
state FeedbackGiven

LoggedIn --> VisaApplicationPending : ApplyForVisa, MakePayment, AcceptApplication
VisaApplicationPending --> VisaApproved : ViewStatus (if approved)
VisaApplicationPending --> VisaRejected : ViewStatus (if rejected)
LoggedIn --> StatusViewed : ViewStatus
StatusViewed --> FeedbackGiven : GiveFeedback
LoggedIn --> CancelApplication : CancelApplication
LoggedIn --> ModifyDetails : ModifyDetails
LoggedIn --> ViewDetails : ViewDetails
LoggedIn --> UserAccountCreated : Logout

state H <<history*>>

VisaApproved --> [*]
VisaRejected --> [*]
FeedbackGiven --> [*]
CancelApplication --> [*]
ModifyDetails --> [*]
ViewDetails --> [*]

@enduml
